Overview

Platform driver for Raspberry Pi 5.

Features:

Device Tree Overlay
GPIO acquisition
IRQ registration
Interrupt handling
Workqueue processing
Sysfs attributes
Character device
Wait queue
Mutex synchronization


Topic Covered:
Platform Drivers
Device Tree
GPIO Subsystem
IRQ Handling
Workqueues
Atomic Variables
Mutexes
Wait Queues
Character Devices
Sysfs
Kernel/User Communication

Character Device:
/dev/gpio_interrupt_device

Sysfs:
value
irq_count
last_press_time

Architecture:
Button
